伤害。\n\n重击·雷山小过\n长按普攻，按从左到右顺序消耗高亮状态下的【卦象·震】和【卦象·艮】可施放重击·雷山小过，造成较少导电伤害，额外削减共振度。\n\n重击·艮为山\n长按普攻，按从左到右顺序消耗高亮状态下的【卦象·艮】和【卦象·艮】可施放重击·艮为山，回复附近队伍中所有角色的生命值。\n\n重击·震为雷\n长按普攻，按从左到右顺序消耗高亮状态下的【卦象·震】和【卦象·震】可施放重击·震为雷，持续回复附近队伍中所有角色的生命值，每秒回复1次，持续8秒。\n\n重击·鬼门占卦\n长按普攻时，若不足2枚【卦象】，则卜灵进入卜卦失败状态，消耗全部【卦象】并损失20%的当前生命值；当卜灵生命低于1%时，不消耗生命值。\n\n空中攻击\n消耗耐力进行空中下落攻击，造成导电伤害。\n\n闪避反击\n成功闪避后一定时间内短按普攻，将会施放普攻第3段攻击目标，造成导电伤害。\n·施放闪避反击后一定时间内短按普攻，将会施放普攻第4段。\n\n【卦象】获取规则\n【卦象】上限4枚，达上限时，再次获取【卦象】，所有【卦象】将左移1格，最左侧【卦象】将被移除。\n·普攻第2段造成伤害时获得【卦象·艮】。\n·普攻第4段、空中攻击造成伤害时获得【卦象·震】。\n·施放共鸣技能·遁影牵雷时获得【卦象·震】。","descEn":"Basic Attack\nPerform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nHeavy Attack - Mountain Over Thunder\nHold Normal Attack to consume the highlighted Trigram - Mountain and Trigram - Thunder from left to right and cast Heavy Attack - Mountain Over Thunder, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nHeavy Attack - Thunder Over Mountain\nHold Normal Attack to consume the highlighted Trigram - Thunder and Trigram - Mountain from left to right and cast Heavy Attack - Thunder Over Mountain, dealing a small amount of Electro DMG and additionally reducing the target's Vibration Strength.\n\nHeavy Attack - Twin Mountains\nHold Normal Attack to consume the highlighted 2 Trigrams - Mountain from left to right and cast Heavy Attack - Twin Mountains, healing all nearby Resonators in the team.\n\nHeavy Attack - Twin Thunders\nHold Normal Attack to consume the highlighted 2 Trigrams - Thunder from left to right and cast Heavy Attack - Twin Thunders, healing all nearby Resonators in the team once per second for 8s.\n\nHeavy Attack - Ghost Gate Omen\nWhen holding Normal Attack with fewer than 2 Trigrams, Buling fails the divination, becoming temporarily immobilized and losing all Trigrams and 20% of her current HP. This effect will not consume HP if Buling's current HP is below 1%.\n\nMid-air Attack\nConsume STA to perform Mid-air Attack, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nDodge Counter\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Normal Attack right after a successful Dodge to perform Basic Attack Stage 3, dealing Electro DMG.\n- After performing Dodge Counter, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Normal Attack to perform Basic Attack Stage 4.\n\nTrigram\nBuling can hold up to 4 Trigrams. When Trigrams reach the max number, gaining new Trigrams moves all Trigrams 1 slot to the left, and the original leftmost Trigram will be removed.\n- Trigram - Mountain is obtained when Basic Attack Stage 2 deals damage.\n- Trigram - Thunder is obtained when Basic Attack Stage 4 or Mid-air Attack deals damage.\n- Trigram - Thunder is obtained when casting Resonance Skill - In Shadow Thunder Stirs.","params":[{"label":"第一段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 1 DMG","values":["10.43%*2","11.28%*2","12.14%*2","13.34%*2","14.19%*2","15.17%*2","16.54%*2","17.91%*2","19.28%*2","20.73%*2"]},{"label":"第二段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 2 DMG","values":["16.83%*2","18.21%*2","19.59%*2","21.52%*2","22.90%*2","24.49%*2","26.69%*2","28.90%*2","31.11%*2","33.45%*2"]},{"label":"第三段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 3 DMG","values":["11.83%*2","12.80%*2","13.77%*2","15.13%*2","16.10%*2","17.21%*2","18.76%*2","20.31%*2","21.87%*2","23.51%*2"]},{"label":"第四段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 4 DMG","values":["47.10%","50.97%","54.83%","60.24%","64.10%","68.54%","74.72%","80.90%","87.08%","93.64%"]},{"label":"空中攻击伤害","labelEn":"Mid-air Attack DMG","values":["37.20%","40.26%","43.31%","47.58%","50.63%","54.13%","59.02%","63.90%","68.78%","73.96%"]},{"label":"闪避反击伤害","labelEn":"Dodge Counter DMG","values":["11.83%*2","12.80%*2","13.77%*2","15.13%*2","16.10%*2","17.21%*2","18.76%*2","20.31%*2","21.87%*2","23.51%*2"]},{"label":"重击·山雷颐伤害","labelEn":"Heavy Attack - Mountain Over Thunder DMG","values":["90.00%","97.38%","104.76%","115.10%","122.48%","130.96%","142.77%","154.58%","166.39%","178.93%"]},{"label":"重击·雷山小过伤害","labelEn":"Heavy Attack - Thunder Over Mountain DMG","values":["45.00%","48.69%","52.38%","57.55%","61.24%","65.48%","71.39%","77.29%","83.20%","89.47%"]},{"label":"重击·艮为山治疗量","la